      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Additional information: On SDK3 avatars the position returned by these functions is offset during some animations (eg default prone animation). On SDK2, the marker follows the hip bone in crouch mode only when moving.\nNote that all of these tests I've been doing are in desktop mode. Behavior might be different in VR.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
