  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-08-15T23:02:08.372Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "GetLocalBonePosition/Rotation on the Hips bone seem to track the player capsule, rather than the Hips bone, on SDK2 avatars. On SDK3 avatars, they track the avatar's hip bone, but seemingly with a short delay.\nTest udon prefab: https://www.dropbox.com/s/mtyueikte8usrr6/test%20hip%20tracker.unitypackage?dl=0\nRepro:\n1. Place the above prefab in a world.\n2. Switch locally to a SDK3 avatar. The prefab will follow your hips, with a short delay.\n3. Switch locally to a SDK2 avatar. The prefab will follow your player capsule.\nExpected result: The prefab should follow the hip bone precisely and without delay for all humanoid avatars.",
